		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--muted);
		min-width: 16px;
	}
	.author-liked-wrap {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row;
		margin-top: 6px;
	}
	.author-liked {
		padding: 4px 10px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #F3F4F3;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 11px;
	}

	/* 楼中楼：缩进流式，不再是浅底卡片 */
	.reply {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: row;
		gap: 9px;
		margin-top: 12px;
	}
	.reply-avatar {
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--soft);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
